publishedfiledetails.file_description:
A pure English version have been uploaded here:
https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1596632143

Besides [b]all the functions[/b] from Aerial View mod, this mod add a new feature:

As long as you hover the mouse over [b]any entity[/b] or [b]any position[/b] you want to observe and press the preset shortcut key, the camera will focus on that entity or position.

The observed entity could be other player, a monster, or even a tree.

Think about that when you hide in the berry bush and watch your friend solo a boss, and you want to get closer but are afraid of being attacked, all you need to do is to switch the focus of the camera to your friend, or even to the boss, isn't it funnnnnny?

[h1][Version 1.3.4] - Update:[/h1]
Fixed the bug of message overlap.

[h1][Version 1.3.3] - Update:[/h1]
More optional keys have been added and can also be disabled.

[h1][Version 1.3.2] - Instructions:[/h1]
1. Press F9 to switch among default, aerial and vertical view mode;
2. Press F10 to hide/show game HUD;
3. Press F11 to hide/show your character;
4. Press O to focus the camera on the entity under mouse;
5. Press P to focus the camera on the position under mouse;
6. Press R to switch the focus of the camera between your character and recent selected entity/position;
7. Press ↑, ↓, ← and → to modify the FOV of the camera. (From 20 to 120, default value is 35.)

Part of the key-bindings could be configured in mod configuration.

Thanks for Aerial View mod and its author, you can find Aerial View mod here: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=694531911
